# Read by Flux's source-controller when it packs the GitRepository artifact, and applied after
# its built-in excludes. Those excludes drop every *.png, so config/branding's app icon never
# reached the cluster and glance-config failed to build on a file kustomize could see locally.
# Re-include it. Nothing else in the tree ships a binary Flux has to read.
!config/branding/**/*.png

# brokkr is not in the cluster. Its Podman units are reconciled by a timer on the node itself
# (ansible/roles/quadlet_gitops), and nothing in the Flux tree references them. Excluded so the
# artifact Flux packs holds only what Flux reconciles — kustomize already ignores the directory,
# since nodes/kustomization.yaml lists its resources explicitly.
nodes/brokkr.podman/
